                                "example_id": "aabcacec-f7b0-4dbe-945f-deb4132acb0f",
                                "sense_id": "9c56b894-a33e-325d-951b-8f2bc71ca5af",
                                "text": "The latter had just bucked on his sword, and, in spite of the heat, buttoned up his undress coatee to the chin, ready for the short spell of drill which he knew would take place before the officers dined; […]"
